# Third-party actions that are NOT pinned to a commit SHA.
#
# Pinning is the default (B5-L1): a mutable tag like `@v2` means the publisher
# can change the code that runs in a job holding `id-token: write`. Only
# `NuGet/login` remains on a tag, because its commit SHA could not be resolved
# when the pin was introduced (no network access to the registry). Resolve it
# with
#
#     git ls-remote https://github.com/NuGet/login refs/tags/v1
#
# and replace the entry below with `NuGet/login@<40-hex-sha>  # v1`. Every other
# third-party action must be a full SHA or the workflow lint fails.
# scripts/tests/workflow_lint.py reads this file.
NuGet/login@v1
